<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 00:34:32 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>大学生管理财务的七种方法——因为金钱决策会影响毕业后开始第一份工作时的财务安全</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/how-to-manage-money-in-college-student-loans-building-credit-saving/</link><description>如果您今年秋天开始上大学或者您目前是一名学生，这里有一些专家的建议。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26223420698150-e1786834692871.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 23:08:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/how-to-manage-money-in-college-student-loans-building-credit-saving/</guid></item><item><title>哈佛基金披露持有马斯克旗下 SpaceX 价值 22 亿美元的股份</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/harvard-management-fund-endowment-spacex-stake-university-california-north-carolina/</link><description>其他获利的机构包括加州大学的投资部门以及北卡罗来纳大学和圣路易斯华盛顿大学。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2289079202-e1786833992622.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 22:52:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/harvard-management-fund-endowment-spacex-stake-university-california-north-carolina/</guid></item><item><title>阿里巴巴AI模型下载量突破30亿次，超越Meta、Google</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/alibaba-qwen-open-ai-models-3-billion-downloads-meta-google/</link><description>阿里巴巴人工智能模型家族Qwen已开源460多个模型，其生态系统催生了30万多个衍生品。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2196327182-e1786833344888.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 22:39:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/alibaba-qwen-open-ai-models-3-billion-downloads-meta-google/</guid></item><item><title>斯科特·贝森特发射了货币火箭筒，但全球金融看起来仍然像一座由深陷困境的日元支撑的“巨型叠叠乐塔”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/scott-bessent-dollar-yen-carry-trade-global-finance-jenga-tower-fed-rates-bank-of-japan/</link><description>“现在交易员正在关注‘日元套利交易’，廉价的日元借贷资金押注于全球高收益资产，并想知道它是否会爆炸。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2275213554-e1786827040619.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 22:20:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/scott-bessent-dollar-yen-carry-trade-global-finance-jenga-tower-fed-rates-bank-of-japan/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普政府告诉最高法院，尽管有停止命令，但舞厅建设必须继续进行，理由是空军一号最近受到导弹威胁</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/trump-supreme-court-white-house-ballroom-construction-missile-threat-air-force-one/</link><description>副检察长称其为“位于白宫东翼的综合军事设施，包括一个完全安全的宴会厅空间，这是国家安全所迫切需要的。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26217653890614_12e986-e1786823562531.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 20:04:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/trump-supreme-court-white-house-ballroom-construction-missile-threat-air-force-one/</guid></item><item><title>“我永远不会道歉”——特朗普不理会伊朗战争对油价的影响，并称航母在海上的240多天“还不够长”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/trump-iran-war-oil-prices-abraham-lincoln-aircraft-carriers-record-time-sea/</link><description>特朗普承认，他对美国军队的使用“比我想要的多一点”，同时再次声称美国针对伊朗的行动进展顺利。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26226626090930-e1786822447473.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 19:41:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/trump-iran-war-oil-prices-abraham-lincoln-aircraft-carriers-record-time-sea/</guid></item><item><title>顶级经济学家表示，随着更多有利因素汇聚，关税退款正在提振企业利润和 GDP，推动经济增长达到 4.3% 的惊人速度</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/tariff-refunds-corporate-profits-gdp-tailwinds-4-3-percent-q3/</link><description>“最重要的是，美国经济继续受到越来越多的有利因素的支撑。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2287125694-e1786817143716.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 19:08:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/tariff-refunds-corporate-profits-gdp-tailwinds-4-3-percent-q3/</guid></item><item><title>伊朗商界领袖承认美国的封锁将造成比战争更大的经济损失，“可能发生的最糟糕的事情”就是试图逃避封锁</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/iran-economic-crisis-us-naval-blockade-war-sanctions-hormuz-oil/</link><description>伊朗-中国联合商会负责人表示，“封锁的后果远远超过直接战争的后果”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/9864328-e1786809525362.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 17:32:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/iran-economic-crisis-us-naval-blockade-war-sanctions-hormuz-oil/</guid></item><item><title>一些赌徒在 eBay 上购买输掉的彩票，以此来抵消赌博获胜的税款</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/gamblers-winning-taxes-offset-deduction-ebay-writeoff-lottery/</link><description>如果您想抵消赌博收入的税款，在 eBay 上购买价值数千美元的输掉的彩票可能会很有利可图。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2248882887-e1786732821623.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/gamblers-winning-taxes-offset-deduction-ebay-writeoff-lottery/</guid></item><item><title>美国证券交易委员会称，Boiler Room 出售退休人员 SpaceX、Anduril、Anthropic 和 Perplexity 筹集了 7400 万美元，同时收取了“巨额隐性费用”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/boiler-room-retirees-fraud-spacex-anduril-anthropic-perplexity/</link><description>处于此案中心的纽约金融家安德鲁·斯帕文塔周五否认了这些指控，并表示他计划为自己辩护。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2281248592-e1786752759414.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 14:38:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/boiler-room-retirees-fraud-spacex-anduril-anthropic-perplexity/</guid></item></channel></rss>